    //   --- GT header style ---
    //   28 = GT header (headerBg fill, bold, center) - matches regular headers
    //   --- GT sub-header style ---
    //   29 = GT sub-header (headerBg fill, normal weight, center) - matches regular sub-headers
    //   --- GT footer styles ---
